2026-06-30 16:02:48,286 | INFO | HTTP Request: POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/chat "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
2026-06-30 16:02:48,286 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Based on our company context, we can design an AI-powered intelligent assistance tool using our Atelier platform, which leverages Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. This approach allows us to provide accurate and reliable information grounded in validated material, such as accounting standards, tax doctrine, and internal procedures.

To meet the requirements, we can design the following AI components:

1. Hybrid retrieval: Our RAG model can be fine-tuned for lexical and semantic search to retrieve relevant regulatory and methodological information from a curated corpus of documents.
2. Template-guided drafting: We can develop template-guided drafting capabilities to assist professionals in drafting professional documents, such as client letters and mission notes, ensuring consistency and accuracy.
3. Multi-document synthesis: Our model can synthesize information from multiple documents to provide support in handling client files and facilitate the continuity of missions between collaborators.

To ensure that our solution remains a non-decisional support tool, we will:

